			"notes": "#### **What has been changed:**\n- **Removed duplicate check for replacement words** — identical replacements can now be used for different words\n- **Preserved uniqueness check for words to be replaced** — the same word cannot be added twice\n\n#### **Examples of operation after changes:**\n\n**✅ WORKS :**\n```\n/replace add qq → hello\n/replace add hi → hello      ✓ Allowed\n/replace add hello → hello  ✓ Allowed\n```\n\n**❌ DOES NOT WORK :**\n```\n/replace add qq → hello\n/replace add qq → test       ✗ Prohibited (word \"qq\" already exists)\n```"
